<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Bay Apts, Ambassador cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Bay Apts, Ambassador cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>- Robertson, Stephens &amp; Co analyst Jay Leupp cut ratings from a buy to long-term attractive on Ambassador Apartments Inc and Bay Apartment Communities due to recent price performance.</p>
